  "description": "<p>Change the volume percent of player’s sound (only yourself) by:</p>\n<h2>Two parameters for two types of sounds:</h2>\n<p><strong>Breath Volume 0-100%</strong>:<br />\nOnBreath (faceshield / mask)<br />\nDehydrated<br />\nExhausted</p>\n<p><strong>Hurt Vocal Volume 0-100%</strong>:<br />\nBleeding, Hit, HurtLight, HurtMedium, HurtHeavy, HurtNearDeath, LegBroken, OnAgony, OnBeingHurt, OnBeingHurtDissapoinment.<br />\n(These are names of sound effect types in EFT client)</p>\n<h2>How to install or uninstall</h2>\n<p>Download the ZIP, open and drag the BepInEx folder to your SPT main folder.<br />\nTo uninstall, just remove BepInEx/plugins/SelfBreathVolume.dll.</p>\n<h4>This is a failed attempt of updating <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1398/quieter-faceshield-breathing\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Arys Quiet Faceshield Breath</a>.</h4>\n",
